# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — ZOODI
## Complete Production-Ready E-Commerce Website with Firebase Backend, Customer Storefront, and Role-Based Admin Dashboard

### 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a complete, professional, production-oriented full-stack e-commerce website for **ZOODI**, an Indian fashion and lifestyle shopping brand.

This is a NEW PROJECT. Build the entire application with a clean architecture, professional UI, secure authentication, a real Firebase backend, and fully connected customer and admin interfaces.

This must NOT be a static demo, a UI-only prototype, or a collection of non-functional buttons.

Every implemented feature must work with real application logic and persistent database storage.

**Core requirement:** When an authorized administrator changes something in the admin panel, the corresponding changes must automatically appear on the customer website wherever applicable.

Use Firebase as the primary backend.

Do not simply create mock dashboards or fake functionality. Implement real operations and clearly distinguish demo seed data from actual customer activity.

